            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.43

- Adds an Accessibility permission prompt when CodexMate is running in menu bar mode without the required macOS permission.
- Opens System Settings directly to Privacy & Security > Accessibility from the permission alert.
- Stops the menu bar keyboard navigation event tap from failing silently when the permission is missing.
]]></description>
